OL,3,GNEWSA'I swam the Channel fuelled by
OL,4,ABattenberg and tinned peaches'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne man endured jellyfish stings while
OL,7,Fswimming the English Channel, fuelled
OL,8,Fby tinned peaches and mini Battenberg
OL,9,Fcakes.
OL,11,FNev Trotter successfully completed the
OL,12,Fsolo swim to raise money for the
OL,13,FAlzheimer's Society in memory of his
OL,14,Fmum who died earlier this year after a
OL,15,F"long fight" with the disease.
OL,17,FThe dad of two from Sutton Coldfield
OL,18,Fset off at 05:00 BST on Monday morning
OL,19,Fand after 18 hours and 28 minutes later
OL,20,Fhe reached France.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
