OL,3,GNEWSA'I swam the Channel fuelled by
OL,4,ABattenberg and tinned peaches'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In the days before [the swim], I was
OL,7,Fthinking I can't even remember how to
OL,8,Fswim. I don't know what's going on. Why
OL,9,Fam I doing this? And I just needed to
OL,10,Fbe in the water," he recalled.
